# Multi-bass oscillators for NTS-1

This repository maintains a **set of genre bass/kick user oscillators** for the
NTS-1 (logue SDK v1.1.0 / `nutekt-digital`). The hardware holds one custom osc
at a time; each folder under `src/oscillators/` is a standalone loadable unit.

## When adding or editing units

- Target **NTS-1 mkI** first (`nutekt-digital`, API 1.1-0).
- Prefer **multifunction** design: one macro (usually **Vibe**) morphs related
  styles instead of multiple single-purpose binaries.
- Document **presets** in `manifest.json` → `_agent.presets` (values 0–100 unless
  noted). Order matches `header.params`.
- Use host `params->cutoff` and `params->resonance` for filter-based bass oscs;
  kick/sub units may ignore them.
- Register new units in `docs/nts1-multi-bass-oscillators.md` and
  `tools/build-all-bass.sh`.
- Do not merge unrelated genres into one osc; add a new folder instead.

## Current collection

- `tr808-kick` — phonk / 808 kick-sub
- `west-coast-moog` — P-Funk / Minimoog / West Coast
- `juno-rnb` — Juno-106 80s R&B bass
- `dilla-bass` — J Dilla style wobble/glide/warm bass
